{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123724","id":4605772187,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEoaBmw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123724","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123724.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123724.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123724","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123724/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123724/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123724/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/71f8f575de436b9efe1ebec683097bcf754b5152","number":123724,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix toolbars from not being centered on non-standard font sizes","user":{"login":"Komariarii","id":301026105,"node_id":"U_kgDOEfFLOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301026105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii","html_url":"https://github.com/Komariarii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Komariarii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR centers the newly styled Toolbars to be properly centered. This is normally fine, but if an editor has non-default font, this causes the Toolbar to get aligned to the top, which doesn't look great. \r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"1021\" height=\"112\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9fab98fe-1941-43e2-9590-c1774fa805b6\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"980\" height=\"115\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f447704-7311-4edd-bf23-318ca3f659f8\" />\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIn my testing with non-default font sizes, this also causes the Embedded Game Toolbar to look rather odd as the text gets really big compared to how small the buttons remain (due to the maximize size set)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"887\" height=\"107\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d48cd896-69cb-40b8-90a3-895f9ce514b6\" />\r\n\r\nIdeally there would be some kind of ratio these elements get scaled to depending on font-size, but this is the simplest fix for the most glaring issue right now.\r\n\r\nNo AI was used","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_